@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Shared model system prompts
+
+Public entry: `index.ts` / `contract.ts`. Layer: domain. No IO, settings file access or network.
+
+Owns the persistent settings shape `modelSystemPromptAppends`, per-entry normalization, the 20-entry bound, and exact `providerId + modelId` resolution. It does not build prompt sections or decide when they are applied; the CLI prompt layer consumes this contract with the actual execution model.
+
+Entry text has no application-level character limit: the full text is stored, frozen into the submission, and passed to the provider. Only the entry count is capped at 20. Patch writes reject empty IDs, empty text and duplicate provider/model pairs. Full settings reads sanitize stale disk values by dropping invalid entries and keeping the last duplicate, so one bad record cannot invalidate the whole settings document.
